  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "I wake up hungry and find Father in the kitchen, where he is ready to cook breakfast. An egg is in the pan on the stove, and Father tells me to stay back because the pan is hot. At the table, I cut the warm bread with a knife while he watches my hands. Then I spread a little butter from the plate on a slice. A fresh orange waits beside the juice, and a full glass of milk is ready for me. I bring another glass to the table so Father can have juice with his food. He takes a bowl from the shelf and puts our fruit in it. When the egg is ready, we sit down together, and I drink my milk before it is time for school. Helping with a small job makes our morning meal feel special.",
    "textZh": "我醒來時肚子餓了，走到廚房，發現爸爸正準備做早餐。爐子上的平底鍋裡有一顆蛋，爸爸提醒我退後，因為鍋子很燙。我在桌邊用刀子切溫熱的麵包，爸爸看著我的手。接著我從盤子裡取一點奶油，抹在一片麵包上。果汁旁放著一顆新鮮柳橙，一杯裝滿的牛奶也準備好給我喝。我再拿一個玻璃杯到桌上，讓爸爸用餐時可以喝果汁。他從架子上拿一個碗，把我們的水果放進去。蛋煎好後，我們一起坐下來；上學前，我把牛奶喝完。幫忙做一點小事，讓早上的這頓飯感覺很特別。",
